    {
      "uid": "zhcn:175b85b7b4d84863e55d5cc0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她叫神业。是去年的『菊花赏』赛马娘，\n人如其名，在那场多年不遇的糟糕场地里，\n如奇迹般奔跑取胜的GⅠ赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "05d456fd2004df17ec4251638563eed1d84f969e81f5cfd0272b8ae4527dc9d2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
